{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447","id":2731871263,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i1Qwf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109447","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109447/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/31ee691fbf4f04990cf25c92603113000462a209","number":109447,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement a very simple SSAO in GLES3.","user":{"login":"jon1solution","id":143551917,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI5trQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143551917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution","html_url":"https://github.com/jon1solution","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This adds a very simple SSAO implementation to the Compatibility renderer.  It addresses [Proposal # 12059](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12059)\r\n\r\nThis is not an implementation of a previous technique...I call this one S4AO (Stupid Simple Screen Space Ambient Occlusion [8^) \r\n S4AO is designed to:\r\n- work directly in the reversed-Z clip space that Godot already uses\r\n- avoid branching (there are loops with fixed endpoints, so they can be trivially unrolled by the shader compiler)\r\n- not require half-resolution \r\n- not require a subsequent blur pass\r\n\r\nThe SSAO parameters used are:\r\n- Radius (works as you would expect, though this is used more like a ratio of inverse-depth, than as physical units)\r\n- Intensity (this is used exactly the same...higher values yield more darkening)\r\n- Detail (this one is hacked to be used as the sample falloff threshold...I recommend leaving it at the default 0.5)\r\n\r\nThere is a very simple 2D random rotation built into the sampling to break up obvious sampling patterns.  On my GTX 1650 Ti, fullscreen at 1920x1080, S4AO takes approximately 0.6 ms.\r\n\r\nHere is a screenshot of S4AO in subtle action:\r\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"687\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8ac1706-55c1-4ad0-b2d7-5d4d42cef35a\" />\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12059","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-08T22:15:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T18:46:24Z","closed_at":"2025-11-01T18:11:38Z","merged_at":"2025-11-01T18:11:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"85e47d6facd9477c6d85d287166f6fb59fbac2e3","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c